I keep the strong “exhaust near-maintenance robots early” behavior, but make it mixed-duty-aware by comparing remaining work budget first, by distinguishing last-duty robots whose maintenance will return before the horizon (use early) from those that will not (hold as reserve), and by demoting the random `gene_type` in the new-robot order unless it is also the best fit for the remaining horizon.

```python
