This hybrid keeps Rule 1’s mixed-length detection and non-mixed load-balanced reuse logic, adds Rule 2’s gene-type preference for new robots in mixed instances, and applies the late-horizon maintenance-aware ordering to both branches so end-of-horizon duties are less likely to trigger useless maintenance. It returns the same action format and remains deterministic and O(number of robots).

